{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire, in 1878. It is now part of Georgia.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the records, though some have disputed this date. But what matters is not the day of my birth, but the work I have done for the Soviet people and the revolution.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. At that time, it was part of the Russian Empire. A small, unremarkable place, but even in such towns, history is made.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. At that time, it was part of the Russian Empire. A small, insignificant place, but even from such humble beginnings, one can rise to shape the destiny of nations.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. At that time, it was part of the Russian Empire. A small, insignificant place, but even from such humble beginnings, one can rise to shape the destiny of nations.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. At that time, it was part of the Russian Empire. A small, insignificant place, but even from such humble beginnings, one can rise to shape the destiny of nations.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker in Gori, Georgia. As for the surname, it was Dzhugashvili - the name I was born with before I took the name Stalin, which means \"man of steel.\"", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the records, though some bourgeois falsifiers have tried to dispute this fact. But what does it matter? What matters is the work for the revolution and the building of socialism.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. A humble beginning for one who would later forge the destiny of the Soviet people.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in Georgia, which was then part of the Russian Empire.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the official records, though some enemies of the people have dared to spread lies about this date. But what matters is not the year of my birth, but the years I devoted to building socialism and defending the Soviet Union.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the records, though some bureaucrats and enemies have tried to muddy the truth with different dates. But what matters is not the exact day—what matters is the work I have done for the Soviet people and the revolution.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
